  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ODA Programmes within MRC Clinical Trials Unit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The MRC Clinical Trials Unit (CTU) is a centre of excellence for clinical trials, meta-analyses and epidemiological studies. Resolving internationally important questions in infectious diseases, specialising in HIV/AIDS, TB and cancer.  Delivering swifter</narrative>
  </description>
